#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Failed to enable JWT authentication"
msgstr "Kunne ikke aktivere JWT-godkendelse"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To implement SSO you will need to add a new endpoint to your app. You can connect Metabase to your identity provider using JSON Web Tokens (JWT) to authenticate people. Enabling JWT authentication will also create a signing key and enable group sync."
msgstr "For at implementere SSO skal du tilføje et nyt endpoint til din app. Du kan forbinde Metabase til din identitetsudbyder med JSON Web Tokens (JWT) for at godkende personer. Aktivering af JWT-godkendelse vil også oprette en signeringsnøgle og aktivere gruppesynkronisering."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "This is where Metabase will redirect login requests"
msgstr "Det er her, Metabase vil omdirigere loginanmodninger"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Enable JWT authentication and continue"
msgstr "Aktivér JWT-godkendelse og fortsæt"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/hooks/use-get-embedding-hub-steps.ts
msgid "Configure SSO"
msgstr "Konfigurér SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Set up JWT authentication"
msgstr "Konfigurer JWT-godkendelse"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Add a new endpoint to your app"
msgstr "Tilføj et nyt endpoint til din app"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/SetupSsoPage.tsx
msgid "Test that JWT authentication is working correctly"
msgstr "Test at JWT-godkendelse fungerer korrekt"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Failed to save SSO test status"
msgstr "Kunne ikke gemme SSO-teststatus"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try logging in with SSO. Did it work?"
msgstr "Prøv at logge ind med SSO. Virkede det?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "To check if JWT authentication was configured successfully, open Metabase in a different browser or in a private tab and try logging in to your account using single sign-on (SSO). Is login working correctly?"
msgstr "For at tjekke, om JWT-godkendelse blev konfigureret korrekt, skal du åbne Metabase i en anden browser eller i en privat fane og prøve at logge ind på din konto med single sign-on (SSO). Virker login korrekt?"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "No, I couldn't log in"
msgstr "Nej, jeg kunne ikke logge ind"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Log in works, I'm done"
msgstr "Login virker, jeg er færdig"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "Fejlfinding"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Try the steps below before testing JWT authentication again. If nothing works, consider contacting support."
msgstr "Prøv trinene nedenfor, før du tester JWT-godkendelse igen. Hvis intet virker, kan du overveje at kontakte support."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "404 error after SSO sign-in"
msgstr "404-fejl efter SSO-login"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after clicking on \"Sign in with SSO\", the browser returns a 404 error, make sure the value of the JWT SSO URI in admin settings / auth / JWT is pointing to your endpoint and your endpoint is up and running and available."
msgstr "Hvis browseren returnerer en 404-fejl efter at du har klikket på \"Sign in with SSO\", så sørg for, at værdien for JWT SSO URI i administratorindstillinger / auth / JWT peger på dit endpoint, og at dit endpoint kører og er tilgængeligt."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "JWT decryption error: \"Message seems corrupt\""
msgstr "JWT-dekrypteringsfejl: \"Message seems corrupt\""

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\" there was an issue decrypting signed JWT. Ensure METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET has the right value."
msgstr "Hvis du efter at være blevet omdirigeret fra din app til Metabase ser \"Message seems corrupt or manipulated\", var der et problem med at dekryptere signeret JWT. Sørg for, at METABASE_JWT_SHARED_SECRET har den rigtige værdi."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Tenant ID mismatch error"
msgstr "Fejl ved uoverensstemmelse i lejer-id"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", your application is trying to sign in a the user with the wrong tenant slug. Review @tenant claim in the JWT and ensure it matches the tenant this tenant user belongs to."
msgstr "Hvis du efter at være blevet omdirigeret fra din app til Metabase ser en fejlmeddelelse \"Tenant ID mismatch with existing user\", forsøger din applikation at logge brugeren ind med den forkerte lejer-slug. Gennemgå @tenant-claimet i JWT'en, og sørg for, at det matcher den lejer, denne lejerbruger tilhører."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "User provisioning disabled for JWT SSO"
msgstr "Brugerprovisionering deaktiveret for JWT SSO"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "If after being redirected from your app to Metabase, you see an error message \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO."
msgstr "Hvis du efter at være blevet omdirigeret fra din app til Metabase ser en fejlmeddelelse \"Sorry, but you'll need a $SITENAME account to view this page, contact your administrator. User provisioning is turned off for JWT SSO in admin settings/authentication. Either turn this feature on to have users be provisioned if they don't exist yet, or ensure users exist before signing them in via JWT SSO.\", er brugerprovisionering slået fra for JWT SSO i administratorindstillinger/godkendelse. Enten skal du slå funktionen til, så brugere provisioneres, hvis de ikke findes endnu, eller sikre at brugere findes, før du logger dem ind via JWT SSO."

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/SetupSsoPage/TestJwtStep.tsx
msgid "Contact customer support"
msgstr "Kontakt kundesupport"

#: frontend/src/metabase/embedding/embedding-hub/components/StepperWithCards/StepperWithCards.tsx
msgid "Complete the other steps to unlock"
msgstr "Fuldfør de andre trin for at låse op"

