msgid "Set the embedding model for the selected provider"
msgstr "Indstil embedding-modellen for den valgte udbyder"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Prefix prepended to search queries (but not indexed documents) before embedding them, as expected by asymmetric retrieval models such as the snowflake-arctic-embed family. It is prepended verbatim, so include any trailing separator. Leave empty to use the default for the model, which varies by generation: Arctic Embed v2.0 expects `query: `, earlier versions expect a longer instruction."
msgstr "Præfiks, der sættes foran søgeforespørgsler (men ikke indekserede dokumenter) før de indlejres, som forventet af asymmetriske retrieval-modeller som snowflake-arctic-embed-familien. Det foranstilles ordret, så medtag eventuel efterfølgende separator. Lad stå tomt for at bruge standarden for modellen, som varierer efter generation: Arctic Embed v2.0 forventer `query: `, tidligere versioner forventer en længere instruktion."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Set the dimension size for the selected embedding model"
msgstr "Indstil dimensionsstørrelsen for den valgte embedding-model"

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "URL of the OpenAI-compatible embedding service (e.g. a LiteLLM proxy)."
msgstr "URL til den OpenAI-kompatible embedding-tjeneste (f.eks. en LiteLLM-proxy)."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "API key for authenticating with the embedding service. Leave empty for proxying thorugh ai-service. In that case premium-embedding-token is used for authentication."
msgstr "API-nøgle til godkendelse med embedding-servicen. Lad stå tomt for at proxy'e gennem ai-service. I så fald bruges premium-embedding-token til godkendelse."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Wrap embedding-service calls in a circuit breaker that fails fast after repeated failures. Runtime kill switch; the breaker thresholds are fixed."
msgstr "Pak kald til embedding-tjenesten ind i en circuit breaker, der fejler hurtigt efter gentagne fejl. Runtime-kill switch; breaker-tærsklerne er faste."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "The maximum number of tokens sent in a single embedding API call."
msgstr "Det maksimale antal tokens sendt i et enkelt embedding API-kald."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Maximum number of results to return from a single semantic search query."
msgstr "Maksimalt antal resultater der returneres fra en enkelt semantisk søgeforespørgsel."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default vector-search strategy for semantic search: `hnsw` (approximate, HNSW-index-backed), `brute-force` (exact, applies non-vector filters first then computes cosine distance over the survivors), or `hnsw-iterative-relaxed`/`hnsw-iterative-strict` (HNSW-index-backed iterative scans with inline filters). Defaults to `brute-force`, which needs no index; selecting `hnsw` builds the HNSW index just-in-time. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_strategy` API parameter."
msgstr "Standard vektorsøgningsstrategi for semantisk søgning: `hnsw` (approksimativ, understøttet af HNSW-indeks), `brute-force` (eksakt, anvender først ikke-vektorfiltre og beregner derefter cosinusafstand på de overlevende), eller `hnsw-iterative-relaxed`/`hnsw-iterative-strict` (HNSW-indeks-understøttede iterative scans med inline-filtre). Standard er `brute-force`, som ikke kræver noget indeks; ved valg af `hnsw` bygges HNSW-indekset just-in-time. Enkeltstående anmodninger kan tilsidesætte dette via API-parameteren `vector_search_strategy`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
msgid "Default pgvector `hnsw.ef_search` (HNSW candidate-list size) for the `hnsw-iterative-*` strategies. Larger values improve recall at the cost of latency. Individual requests may override this via the `vector_search_ef_search` API parameter."
msgstr "Standard pgvector `hnsw.ef_search` (størrelse på HNSW-kandidatliste) for `hnsw-iterative-*`-strategierne. Større værdier forbedrer recall på bekostning af latenstid. Enkeltstående anmodninger kan tilsidesætte dette via API-parameteren `vector_search_ef_search`."

#: metabase_enterprise/semantic_search/settings.clj
